  - name: Dummy Test Error xMatters
    detail: Checks for the existence of a dummy file to veryfy alert targets are functioning IGNORE THIS ALERT
    fluxfile: flux/dummy_error.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 0
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
    interval: 60
    target: xapi
    action: Do nothing. This is a sythetic error to allow xMatters alert testing. 
  - name: Dummy Test Error Postfix
    detail: Checks for the existence of a dummy file to veryfy alert targets are functioning IGNORE THIS ALERT
    fluxfile: flux/dummy_error.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 0
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
    interval: 60
    target: postfix
    action: Do nothing. This is a sythetic error to allow postfix email alert testing. 
